{\rtf1\ansi\uc1{\*\generator WTS5;}\adeflang1025\adeff0\deff0\stshfdbch0\stshfloch0\stshfhich0\deflang1033\deflangfe1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fcharset0 Latha;}{\f2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f3\fcharset0 MEPS Bookman WTS;}{\f4\fbidi\fcharset177 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red128\green0\blue128;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green128\blue0;\red153\green51\blue102;\red102\green102\blue153;\red51\green51\blue204;\red128\green0\blue0;}{\stylesheet {\s2\ltrpar\qc \rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f0\fs36\cf1\b \sbasedon0\snext21 Title;}{\s11\ltrpar\qc \rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\fs24\cf8\b \sbasedon0\snext25 Heading 1;}}\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033\ltrdoc\fcs1\af0\afs24\acf0\fcs0\f0\fs24\cf0{\info\uc1{\upr{\*\ud{\author \u67?\u111?\u112?\u121?\u114?\u105?\u103?\u104?\u116?\u32?\u169?\u32?\u50?\u48?\u50?\u49?\u32?\u87?\u97?\u116?\u99?\u104?\u32?\u84?\u111?\u119?\u101?\u114?\u32?\u66?\u105?\u98?\u108?\u101?\u32?\u97?\u110?\u100?\u32?\u84?\u114?\u97?\u99?\u116?\u32?\u83?\u111?\u99?\u105?\u101?\u116?\u121?\u32?\u111?\u102?\u32?\u80?\u101?\u110?\u110?\u115?\u121?\u108?\u118?\u97?\u110?\u105?\u97?}}}{\upr{\*\ud{\title \u76?\u101?\u115?\u115?\u111?\u110?\u160?\u49?\u51?\u8212?\u72?\u111?\u119?\u32?\u70?\u97?\u108?\u115?\u101?\u32?\u82?\u101?\u108?\u105?\u103?\u105?\u111?\u110?\u32?\u77?\u105?\u115?\u114?\u101?\u112?\u114?\u101?\u115?\u101?\u110?\u116?\u115?\u32?\u71?\u111?\u100?}}}}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\s2\qc {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f0\fs36\cf1\b Lesson\u160?13\u8212?How False Religion Misrepresents God\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 If God is love, why have so many evil acts been committed by religions that claim to represent him? Put simply, these religions are false; they misrepresent God. How have they misrepresented him? How does he feel about that? And what will he do about it?\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\li720 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 [Image:]\u160?A clergyman preaching in a cathedral.\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 1. How does false religion misrepresent God by its }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b\i teachings}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b ?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 False religion has }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b \u8220?exchanged the truth of God for the lie.\u8221? }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 (}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?pub=nwtsty&bible=45001025&wtlocale=E&srcid=share" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\ul Romans 1:25}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 ) For example, most religions have not taught their followers God\u8217?s name. However, the Bible says that God\u8217?s name must be used. (}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?pub=nwtsty&bible=45010013-45010014&wtlocale=E&srcid=share" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\ul Romans 10:13,14}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 ) Some religious leaders say that when something terrible happens, it is God\u8217?s will. But that is a lie. God is never the source of evil. (Read James 1:13.) Sadly, religious lies have pushed people away from God.\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\li720 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af2\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 [\u8220?Read\u8221? scripture] James 1:13: When under trial, let no one say: \u8220?I am being tried by God.\u8221? For with evil things God cannot be tried, nor does he himself try anyone. [End of \u8220?Read\u8221? scripture]\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 2. How does false religion misrepresent God by its }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b\i actions}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b ?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 False religion does not treat people as Jehovah does. The Bible says that false religion\u8217?s }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b \u8220?sins have massed together clear up to heaven.\u8221? }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 (}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?pub=nwtsty&bible=66018005&wtlocale=E&srcid=share" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\ul Revelation 18:5}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 ) For centuries, religions have meddled in politics, supported wars, and caused or approved the death of countless numbers of people. Some religious leaders enjoy a lavish lifestyle and demand money from their followers to pay for it. These actions prove that they do not even know God, let alone have the right to represent him.\u8212?Read 1\u160?John 4:8.\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\li720 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af2\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 [\u8220?Read\u8221? scripture] 1\u160?John 4:8: Whoever does not love has not come to know God, because God is love. [End of \u8220?Read\u8221? scripture]\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 3. How does God feel about false religion?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 If the things done by false religion make you angry, how do you think Jehovah feels? He loves people, but he is angry with religious leaders who misrepresent him and mistreat their followers. He promises that false religion will be destroyed and }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b \u8220?will never be found again.\u8221? }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 (}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?pub=nwtsty&bible=66018021&wtlocale=E&srcid=share" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\ul Revelation 18:21}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 ) Soon, God will put an end to all false religion.\u8212?}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?pub=nwtsty&bible=66018008&wtlocale=E&srcid=share" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\ul Revelation 18:8}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 .\par}\par\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\qc\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3 Dig Deeper\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 Examine further how God feels about false religion. Learn more about what it has done, but also learn why this should not stop you from getting to know Jehovah.\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 4. God does not approve of all religions\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 Many people believe that religions are like different roads that all lead to God. But is that true? }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b Read }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2\b Matthew 7:13, 1}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 4, }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 and then discuss this question:\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? How does the Bible describe the road that leads to life?\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\li720 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af2\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 [\u8220?Read\u8221? scripture] Matthew 7:13, 14: \u8220?Go in through the narrow gate, because broad is the gate and spacious is the road leading off into destruction, and many are going in through it; whereas narrow is the gate and cramped the road leading off into life, and few are finding it. [End of \u8220?Read\u8221? scripture]\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 Play the video}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\i  }{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?srcid=share&wtlocale=E&lank=pub-lffv_136_VIDEO" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\i\ul Does God Accept All Forms of Worship?\u8212?Excerpt}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\i  }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 (3:22), and then discuss the question that follows.\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? Does the Bible say that there are many religions that please God?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 5. False religion does not reflect God\u8217?s love\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 Religions have misrepresented God in many ways. One notorious way has been their involvement in war. To see one example, play the video}{\field{\*\fldinst {HYPERLINK "https://www.jw.org/finder?srcid=share&wtlocale=E&lank=pub-lffv_137_VIDEO" }}{\fldrslt{\cs4\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf3\i\ul  The Churches\u8217? Role in World War\u160?II}}}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2  (2:22). Then discuss the questions that follow.\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? What position did many churches take during World War\u160?II?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? How do you feel about the position they took?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b Read }{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2\b John 13:34, 3}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b 5 and 17:16.}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2  Then discuss these questions:\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? How must Jehovah feel when religions get involved in war?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 \u8226? False religion is responsible for many bad things. In what ways have you seen religions fail to reflect God\u8217?s love?\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\li720 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af2\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 [\u8220?Read\u8221? scriptures] John 13:34, 35: I am giving you a new commandment, that you love one another; just as I have loved you, you also love one another. By this all will know that you are my disciples\u8212?if you have love among yourselves.\u8221?\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af2\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 John 17:16: They are no part of the world, just as I am no part of the world. [End of \u8220?Read\u8221? scriptures]\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 Pages\u160?56-57 [Image:]\u160?Collage: A cathedral and a pagoda surrounded by scenes depicting ways false religion has promoted war throughout the ages. 1.\u160?The Crusades. 2.\u160?World War\u160?I. 3.\u160?An Orthodox priest blesses a soldier. 4.\u160?An African pastor incites tribal warfare. 5.\u160?Japanese soldiers worship the emperor.\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2 Caption: False religion has not reflected God\u8217?s love\par}\pard\plain\langnp1033\langfenp1033 \ltrpar\ql\fi576 {\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\cf2\b 6}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b . God wants to free people from false religion\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2\b Read Revelation 18:4,\u160?}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\f2 * and then discuss this question:\par}{\rtlch\fcs1\alang1033\af1\ltrch\fcs0\lang103